title: "Neuro-symbolic premise selection with logic-augmented term-walk graph neural networks"
abstract: "Code and data for TW-GNN-LFR, a neuro-symbolic premise selector that combines connective-conditioned term-walk encoding with rare-symbol triggering and continuous symbolic coverage."
